-- title:
--   FM final correction: remove sentinel and carry, reduce modulo 2^N+1
-- statement:
--   Let $N\ge1$, $s$ a state, $0\le z<2^{N+1}$ and $|c|\le 2^N$. Assume `ZZ` has $z$ on top (over $L_Z$), `CY` has $c$ on top (over $L_Y$), `RN` has $2^N$ and `RF` has $2^N+1$ on top. Then the segment `fmFinal` runs from $s$ to the state where `ZZ` and `CY` are popped and
--   $$(z-2^N-c)\bmod (2^N+1)$$
--   is pushed on `ARG`, with cost at most $25000\,(N+3)$. The residue is the canonical one in $[0,2^N]$ (Lean's `%` with positive modulus).
--
--   In the Schönhage–Strassen procedure $z$ is the Horner value $2^N+\sum_i d_i 2^{iM}$ (with a leading sentinel $1$) and $c$ is the final carry, whose weight $2^N$ is $\equiv-1$; this step therefore produces the product modulo $2^N+1$.
--
--   **Formalization Note.** States are `IState NS` records with item stacks `G : Fin NS → List Item` (head = top), input pointer `ip` and output `out`; `s.upd X L` replaces stack `X` by `L`; `ints A` is the list of integer items of `A`. The named stacks (`ARG`, `PRM`, `RN`, `RF`, `DX`, `DL`, …) are fixed indices in `Fin 32`. `IRuns I iprog p s s' c` means that `p` executes from `s` to exactly `s'` with some cost $c' \le c$, so costs are upper bounds; the program text `iprog` and input `I` are arbitrary unless constrained.
-- source:
--   A. Schönhage, V. Strassen, Schnelle Multiplikation großer Zahlen, Computing 7 (1971), 281–292 (main theorem: O(n log n log log n) multitape TM multiplication). Lemma `NLogN.fmFinal_runs` of the Lean development NLogN/SSFM3.lean (lines 454–509), written for the prove2.me integer-multiplication campaign.

-- Schönhage–Strassen multitape-TM development (NLogN), generated by skeleton subtraction.

import Definitions.Def_IntMul_SS_Defs2

set_option autoImplicit false
set_option relaxedAutoImplicit false
set_option maxHeartbeats 1000000

open NLogN
open IntMul
variable {P : ℕ} {I : List Sym} {iprog : Fin P → IStmt NS P}

theorem NLogN.fmFinal_runs (s : IState NS) (N : ℕ) (z c : ℤ) (LZ LY LN LF : List Item) (hN1 : 1 ≤ N)
    (hz : 0 ≤ z ∧ z < 2 ^ (N + 1)) (hc : |c| ≤ 2 ^ N)
    (hZ : s.G ZZ = .int z :: LZ) (hY : s.G CY = .int c :: LY)
    (hN : s.G RN = .int (2 ^ N) :: LN) (hF : s.G RF = .int (2 ^ N + 1) :: LF) :
    IRuns I iprog fmFinal s
      (((s.upd ZZ LZ).upd CY LY).upd ARG (.int ((z - 2 ^ N - c) % (2 ^ N + 1)) :: s.G ARG))
      (25000 * (N + 3)) := by sorry
